  "details": "The new \"Live Now\" tab on the main menu no longer has a \"Recently Visited Worlds\" section to show all worlds you have been to recently.\n\nWorse yet, there is no replacement for it. The Worlds menu tab in the main menu doesn't have a \"Recently Visited Worlds\" list.\n\nIt would likely be best to just add a new list to the Worlds menu tab in the main menu that lists \"Recently Visited Worlds\", similar to how \"Recently Played With\" has been moved to the Social menu tab (the new \"Recently Seen\" list).",
